WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.124
Double dimers and random loops.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.955
Overlay two random domino tilings and you get loops.

3
00:00:06.105 --> 00:00:09.294
Zoomed out, physicists expect them to become C L E four.

4
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.512
Claimed: the loops converge curve by curve, in the half plane.

5
00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:17.501
No Lean; one short manuscript.
